<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n1517" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀδῠνᾰμ-ία</span></b> , 
			Ion.
		
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ιη,</span>
		ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>want
				of strength, debility</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>VM</u>
				10
			</span></i>: pl., ib.<i><span class="en">
				19
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.791d
			</span></i>; of medicine, <i>want of strength</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				9.18.4
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> generally,
				<i>inability, incapacity</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				8.111
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Metaph.</u>
				1019b15
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ τοῦ λέγειν ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Antipho
					5.2
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				646b
			</span></i>, etc.: pl., <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>3 Ma.</u>
				2.13
			</span></i>: c. gen., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. τοῦ ἀδικεῖν</span>
			<i>for</i> wrongdoing, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				359b
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν πραγμάτων</span>
			<i>for</i> political action, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Pol.</u>
				1314a23
			</span></i>; [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψυχῆς</span>] <i><span class="en">
				<u>Stoic.</u>
				3.23
			</span></i>: c. inf., <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				532b
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>poverty, lack of resources</i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Oec.</u>
				20.22
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.
				19.186
			</span></i>.</div>
